tone; usually a half-third ↓ in 電腦.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v10.mp3","label":"電腦","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"女兒","s":"女儿"},"py":"nǚ ér","hint":"nǚ: ü = say ‘ee’, then round the lips (tip behind the bottom teeth). First ü in this book.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v14.mp3","label":"女兒","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"都"},"py":"dōu","hint":"d = no puff. ou ≈ ‘oh’. 都 goes in front of the verb: 他們都是學生 / 他們都不是學生.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v16.mp3","label":"都","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"先生"},"py":"xiān sheng","hint":"先 xiān: x = Position 1 + ian. 生 is neutral and light (not shēng here).","audio":[{"src":"audio/v9.mp3","label":"先生","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"畢業了","s":"毕业了"},"py":"bì yè le","hint":"業 yè: ye = ‘ee-eh’. 了 is a light neutral after the 4th.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v18.mp3","label":"畢業了","real":true}]},{"word":{"t":"結婚了","s":"结婚了"},"py":"jié hūn le","hint":"j = Position 1, no puff. ie = ‘ee-eh’. 婚 hūn: h + un. 了 light/neutral.","audio":[{"src":"audio/v19.mp3","label":"結婚了","real":true}]}],"cards":[["Textbook pinyin focus: initials g k h; finals ai, -uo, ang","ai ≈ ‘eye’ (在 zài); -uo ≈ ‘oo-oh’ (國 guó, 作 zuò); ang ends -ng (行 háng). No initial before -uo is written wo (我 wǒ). Tone marks sit on the main vowel in a-o-e-i-u-ü order."]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Grammar","items":[["不 — no, not (textbook Grammar 1)","S + 不 bú / bù + V. 不 goes in front of the verb: 我不是美國人。我不叫 Mary。 (1) 我不是學生。 (2) 我姊姊工作，我哥哥不工作。 (3) 我不叫學文，我叫明文。 (4) 我不是美國人，我是法國人。 [ours] 不 becomes bú before a 4th tone (不是, 不叫); it stays bù before 1st/2nd/3rd (不工作)."],["在 — at, in, on (Grammar 2)","S + 在 + Place + V: 我在電腦公司工作。他在銀行工作。我在小學工作。你在哪裡（哪兒）工作？ The place word sits between 在 and the verb."],["都 — both; all (Grammar 3)","(N plural) + 都 + V. 都 goes in front of the verb and refers to people or things already mentioned: 他們都是學生。Gloria 和 Mary 都姓 Lee。他們都是臺灣人。我先生和我都在銀行工作。"],["都 + 不 — none / neither (Grammar 3-2)","(N plural) + 都 + 不 + V: 他們都不是學生。他們都不姓王。明文和先生都不是美國人。他們都不在銀行工作。 [ours] 都 comes before 不, not after."]]},{"type":"cards","title":"Sound notes","items":[["Textbook pinyin focus: initials g k h, finals ai, -uo, ang","g (no puff, sKill) vs k (big puff): 哥 gē / 工作 gōngzuò. h is a light scratch at the back: 行 háng, 好 hǎo. ai ≈ ‘eye’: 在 zài. -uo is ‘oo-oh’: 國 guó, 作 zuò. ang ends -ng: 行 háng, 剛. (textbook pp.036-037)"],["When -uo has no initial, write wo","Textbook note: with no initial in front of -uo, it is written “wo”, e.g. wǒ 我 (I, me)."],["Third tone change (textbook p.037)","When two 3rd tones occur one after the other, the first changes to a 2nd when speaking, but the third tone mark stays in the written form, e.g. 你好 nǐ hǎo (said ní hǎo), 我有 wǒ yǒu. 哪裡 nǎ lǐ is said ná lǐ."],["不 changes tone (bú / bù)","Textbook lists 不 as bú / bù. Before a 4th tone: bú (不是 bú shì, 不叫 bú jiào). Before 1st/2nd/3rd: bù (不工作 bù gōngzuò). [ours] This is the same rule as later in Lesson 4’s pinyin notes."],["Neutral 了, 們, 子, 生","了 in 畢業了 / 結婚了, 們 in 他們, 子 in 孩子 / 兒子, and 生 in 先生 are short and light. After a 4th (畢業了) the neutral drops low; after a 1st (先生) it sits mid."]]},{"type":"lines","title":"Your turn","zh":null,"kick":"tap to hear, then say it yourself","items":[{"id":"y1","spk":"我","g":"m","en":"I’m not a student. I’m Tian Jiasen.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"],"fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]]},{"ch":"不","py":"bú","t":2,"mk":["bu","↗","#17A398"],"said":"bú"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4,"mk":["p2","2","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["i = buzz","fake i: not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"]]},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"生","py":"shēng","t":1,"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"],["e = uh","short-E: en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"]],"pz":"。"},{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"叫","py":"jiào","t":4,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"田","py":"Tián","t":2,"mk":["puff","ʰ","#E67700"],"fc":[["-n","-n: tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"]]},{"ch":"佳","py":"Jiā","t":1},{"ch":"森","py":"sēn","t":1,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"wǒ","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"wǒ","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"bú shì","cue":"bù → bú before a 4th","kind":"bu"},{"sym":"2","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"sh","cue":"Position 2: tip up · shi ≈ ‘shrr’","kind":"p2"},{"chip":"i = buzz","lab":"shì","cue":"not ‘ee’ — hold the consonant and voice through it"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"x","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"xué","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"shēng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"chip":"e = uh","lab":"shēng","cue":"en/eng ≈ quick ‘uh’ (ba-NA-na)"},{"sym":"ʰ","col":"#E67700","lab":"t","cue":"big puff of air (hand test)","kind":"puff"},{"chip":"-n","lab":"tián","cue":"tip ends on the ridge behind top teeth (ban)"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y1.mp3","label":"我不是學生。我叫田佳森。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y2","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Is your older sister a student?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"是","py":"shì","t":4},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学","mk":["u","ü","#0B7285"]},{"ch":"生","py":"shēng","t":1},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ jiě","cue":"3+3: say ní jiě","kind":"33"},{"sym":"ü","col":"#0B7285","lab":"ü","cue":"say ‘ee’, then round the lips","kind":"u"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y2.mp3","label":"你姊姊是學生嗎？ · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y3","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Where does she work?","cells":[{"ch":"她","py":"Tā","t":1},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4,"mk":["p3","3","#C92A2A"]},{"ch":"哪","py":"nǎ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ná"},{"ch":"裡","py":"lǐ","t":3,"s":"里"},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"3","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"z","cue":"Position 3: tip on top teeth","kind":"p3"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǎ lǐ","cue":"3+3: say ná lǐ","kind":"33"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"g","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y3.mp3","label":"她在哪裡工作？ · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y4","spk":"","g":"m","en":"My older sister works at a bank. (template: swap in your real family)","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"wó"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"銀","py":"yín","t":2,"s":"银"},{"ch":"行","py":"háng","t":2,"mk":["h","~","#E67700"]},{"ch":"工","py":"gōng","t":1},{"ch":"作","py":"zuò","t":4,"pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"wǒ jiě","cue":"3+3: say wó jiě","kind":"33"},{"sym":"~","col":"#E67700","lab":"h","cue":"light scratch at the back","kind":"h"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y4.mp3","label":"我姊姊在銀行工作。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y5","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Do they have two children?","cells":[{"ch":"他","py":"Tā","t":1},{"ch":"們","py":"men","t":5,"s":"们"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yóu"},{"ch":"兩","py":"liǎng","t":3,"s":"两"},{"ch":"個","py":"ge","t":5,"s":"个"},{"ch":"孩","py":"hái","t":2},{"ch":"子","py":"zi","t":5},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yǒu liǎng","cue":"3+3: say yóu liǎng","kind":"33"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y5.mp3","label":"他們有兩個孩子嗎？ · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]},{"id":"y6","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Both kids go to elementary school.","cells":[{"ch":"兩","py":"Liǎng","t":3,"s":"两"},{"ch":"個","py":"ge","t":5,"s":"个"},{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3},{"ch":"孩","py":"hái","t":2},{"ch":"都","py":"dōu","t":1,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"在","py":"zài","t":4},{"ch":"小","py":"xiǎo","t":3},{"ch":"學","py":"xué","t":2,"s":"学"},{"ch":"念","py":"niàn","t":4},{"ch":"書","py":"shū","t":1,"s":"书","pz":"。"}],"cues":[],"audio":[{"src":"audio/y6.mp3","label":"兩個小孩都在小學念書。 · synthetic","real":false,"score":null,"voice":"male"}]}]},{"type":"lines","title":"Review from Lesson 2","zh":null,"kick":"real Lesson 1 clips · tap to hear","items":[{"id":"r1","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Do you have siblings?","cells":[{"ch":"你","py":"Nǐ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3,"mk":["half","↓","#3B5BDB"]},{"ch":"兄","py":"xiōng","t":1,"mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["-ng","-ng: back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"]]},{"ch":"弟","py":"dì","t":4,"mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐","mk":["p1","1","#C92A2A"],"fc":[["ei","ten-E: ei like ‘vein’"]]},{"ch":"妹","py":"mèi","t":4},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ yǒu","cue":"3+3: say ní yǒu","kind":"33"},{"sym":"↓","col":"#3B5BDB","lab":"yǒu","cue":"zombie: stay low, no rise","kind":"half"},{"sym":"1","col":"#C92A2A","lab":"x","cue":"Position 1: tip behind bottom teeth","kind":"p1"},{"chip":"-ng","lab":"xiōng","cue":"back of tongue up, out through the nose (sing)"},{"sym":"°","col":"#E67700","lab":"d","cue":"no puff, no voice: sPin","kind":"nopuff"},{"chip":"ei","lab":"jiě","cue":"ei like ‘vein’"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r1.mp3","label":"你有兄弟姊妹嗎？ · REAL","real":true,"score":0.93,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r2","spk":"","g":"m","en":"I have one older sister and two younger brothers. And you?","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"wó","fc":[["uo","uo: ‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"]]},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3},{"ch":"一","py":"yī","t":1,"mk":["yi","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yí"},{"ch":"個","py":"ge","t":5,"s":"个","mk":["nopuff","°","#E67700"]},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐","pz":"，"},{"ch":"兩","py":"liǎng","t":3,"s":"两"},{"ch":"個","py":"ge","t":5,"s":"个"},{"ch":"弟","py":"dì","t":4},{"ch":"弟","py":"di","t":5,"pz":"。"},{"ch":"妳","py":"Nǐ","t":3,"s":"你"},{"ch":"呢","py":"ne","t":5,"pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"wǒ yǒu","cue":"3+3: say wó yǒu","kind":"33"},{"chip":"uo","lab":"wǒ","cue":"‘oo’ opening to ‘aw’ (wǒ ≈ ‘waw’, no r)"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yī ge","cue":"yī → yí before a 4th","kind":"yi"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r2.mp3","label":"我有一個姊姊，兩個弟弟。妳呢？ · REAL","real":true,"score":0.87,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r3","spk":"","g":"m","en":"I also have one older sister.","cells":[{"ch":"我","py":"Wǒ","t":3},{"ch":"也","py":"yě","t":3,"mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yé"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3},{"ch":"一","py":"yī","t":1,"mk":["yi","↗","#17A398"],"said":"yí"},{"ch":"個","py":"ge","t":5,"s":"个"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jiě","t":3,"s":"姐"},{"ch":"姊","py":"jie","t":5,"s":"姐","pz":"。"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yě yǒu","cue":"3+3: say yé yǒu","kind":"33"},{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"yī ge","cue":"yī → yí before a 4th","kind":"yi"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r3.mp3","label":"我也有一個姊姊。 · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]},{"id":"r4","spk":"","g":"m","en":"Do you have an older brother?","cells":[{"ch":"妳","py":"Nǐ","t":3,"s":"你","mk":["33","↗","#17A398"],"said":"ní"},{"ch":"有","py":"yǒu","t":3},{"ch":"哥","py":"gē","t":1},{"ch":"哥","py":"ge","t":5},{"ch":"嗎","py":"ma","t":5,"s":"吗","pz":"？"}],"cues":[{"sym":"↗","col":"#17A398","lab":"nǐ yǒu","cue":"3+3: say ní yǒu","kind":"33"}],"audio":[{"src":"audio/r4.mp3","label":"妳有哥哥嗎？ · REAL","real":true,"score":1.0,"voice":null}]}]},{"type":"quiz","title":"Self-quiz","kick":"say it aloud, then tap to reveal","items":[["Q1. Ask: ‘Is your older sister a student?’","A: 你姊姊是學生嗎？ Nǐ jiějie shì xuéshēng ma?"],["Q2. Say: ‘She isn’t a student; she graduated from college.’","A: 她不是學生，她大學畢業了。Tā bú shì xuéshēng, tā dàxué bìyè le."],["Q3. Ask: ‘Where does she work?’","A: 她在哪裡工作？ Tā zài nǎlǐ gōngzuò?"],["Q4. Say: ‘My older sister works at a bank.’","A: 我姊姊在銀行工作。Wǒ jiějie zài yínháng gōngzuò."],["Q5. How do you negate 我是學生。?","A: 我不是學生。(不, and 不→bú before 是)"],["Q6. Where does 都 go in ‘They are all students’?","A: 他們都是學生。(都 in front of the verb)"],["Q7. 一個兒子 is said with which tone on 一?","A: yí ge érzi (一 → yí before a 4th-tone 個 gè)"]]}],"schema":1,"date":"2026-11-17T09:40-05:00"}